: Sentence stress","items":[{"label":"Sentence stress","note":"Na frase, acentue palavras de conteúdo (substantivos, verbos, adjetivos) e reduza as funcionais: I WANT to LEARN ENglish.","words":["I want to learn English.","She has studied for years.","Can you help me?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say it is worth doing.","pt":"Diga.","model":"It’s worth visiting."},{"q":"Say it is no use.","pt":"Diga.","model":"It’s no use complaining."},{"q":"Say it is not worth it.","pt":"Diga.","model":"It isn’t worth waiting."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with worth + -ing.","model":"It’s worth studying abroad. It’s worth considering the costs. It’s no use worrying about money. It isn’t worth going unprepared. Language skills are worth building early.","checklist":["Usei **worth + -ing**","Usei **no use + -ing**","5 frases"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “study abroad” mean?","opts":["custo da mensalidade","habilidade de idioma","estudar no exterior"],"ans":2,"why":"**study abroad** = estudar no exterior."},{"q":"What does “tuition cost” mean?","opts":["custo da mensalidade","busca por bolsa","programa de intercâmbio"],"ans":0,"why":"**tuition cost** = custo da mensalidade."},{"q":"What does “scholarship search” mean?","opts":["habilidade de idioma","busca por bolsa","universidade anfitriã"],"ans":1,"why":"**scholarship search** = busca por bolsa."},{"q":"What does “language skill” mean?","opts":["programa de intercâmbio","orçamento de viagem","habilidade de idioma"],"ans":2,"why":"**language skill** = habilidade de idioma."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e pro